  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNCAC Coalition - Civil Society participation in the UNCAC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to civil society to follow and monitor the implementation of the UN Convention on Corruption (UNCAC), shadow reports, website 
The main objective is to increase the transparency and inclusiveness in the second cycle of the review process of the UN Convention against Corruption (UNCAC)
The target group is  civil society organisations in ODA countries involved and engaged in the review process, support parallel reports, facilitate the engagement.</narrative>
  </description>
